			"date": "2026-07-21T14:45:01.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> In German, we have the colloquial term \"Arschkarte\", the \"ass card\": \"To avoid confusion, football referees often keep the yellow card in the chest pocket, while the red card is in the back pocket. The player to whom the referee shows the red card would then have 'got the ass card.'\" (<a href=\"https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arschkarte\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arschkar</span><span class=\"invisible\">te</span></a>)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
